; ZacOS 9 cursors: original 16x16 pixel art in the Mac OS 8 manner
; (black shapes with a white edge, so they show on any background).
;
; "cursor NAME HOTX HOTY [outline] [names...]" then 16 rows: "K" black,
; "W" white, "." transparent. "outline" adds a white edge around every
; black pixel that has none. The names after it are the other Xcursor
; names that get this cursor. "watch" is an original animated dog:
; wagging its tail, then doing a backflip. Compile with
; tools/cursors/build_cursors.py.

